  "details": "Hello, I'm not sure if someone else has already proposed this idea but with the recent introduction with EAC and lots of players losing there ability to use mods within vrchat removing those players of so many features that they either love or can't play the game without this gave me an idea!\nMaybe you guys could add an addons system similar to the steam workshop or similar to addons systems that some MMO games have like ESO.\nThe idea is that the community can produce addons that get pushed on to you guys for verification and if they aren't harmful in anyway you could add them to an addons list that people can download and play with those addons!\nI know the developers at vrchat are hard at work to figure out a solution for this problem that you have now but with people losing so many accessibility mods and other quality of life mods I think this could be very helpful and you guys could keep EAC and not have too many people be upset!\n~ YÆRU",
